  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The Falmer flings her ice spikes all around.
  - The Falmer fires denser ice spikes?
  - The Falmer fires more of those splitting ice spikes.
  - The Falmer, frustated that her strategy has yet to bear fruit, flings out three
    splitting spikes at a time.
  - The Falmer starts raining ice spikes from above.
  - The Falmer starts mixing her ice spikes with flowing beams of frost.
